.mcp.json
**/.DS_Store
*.local.md
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
coverage
out
extension/dist
extension/store-assets
**/*.zip
# The scraper's state, mounted by compose (./scraper/data) and never baked in.
scraper/data
